WEBVTT

NOTE Re-timed to Piper narration (en_US-ljspeech-high, LJ Speech (Keith Ito), public domain). Native review still required.

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:10.031
Choose by exact controller model and connection, not brand alone. Basic
input, rumble, motion and touch controls have separate results. Record

2
00:00:10.031 --> 00:00:17.342
hardware revision, app build, pairing, reconnect, buttons, sticks, triggers
and recovery after rest.

3
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:39.555
Open Master Control and choose Pair. Follow the exact model’s Bluetooth
pairing instructions. If pairing times out, stop searching, confirm pairing

4
00:00:39.555 --> 00:00:45.206
mode and check whether the controller is connected elsewhere before retrying
once.

5
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:10.039
After connection, test buttons and sticks before changing a profile. Select
the intended app or game, review the mapping and apply explicitly. Imported

6
00:01:10.039 --> 00:01:13.987
profiles must be reviewed; they never apply silently.

7
00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:40.294
If Setup cannot find the console, confirm the address and trusted network,
then run checks again. If an app is down, note its version and try its

8
00:01:40.294 --> 00:01:45.554
normal Open action once. Keep the error and support code if it fails.

9
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:11.158
For support include app build, firmware, PC system, controller model,
expected result, actual result and repeatable steps. Review logs before

10
00:02:11.158 --> 00:02:18.863
